      "message": "I can add higher level flog, but still - how we would use it? setvar can fail in limited number of cases, and if it fails - it would mean we have some very strange issue. Check handling of erase request: https://source.corp.google.com/h/chromium/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/cr50/common/new_nvmem.c;l\u003d3220\nIt can fail only if flash write failed in invalidate_object: https://source.corp.google.com/h/chromium/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/cr50/common/new_nvmem.c;l\u003d2258 and that would be logged. Specific variable where it fails won\u0027t gives us anything.",
